Error [jet.InvalidDeriveBang]: `#Inline: false` is not a signed auto-derive trait
  --> tests/ui/marker_inbody/false_without_signed_form.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     #Inline: false
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `false` rejects compiler generation only for structurally auto-derived traits
 Fix: Write `#Inline: true`, or use `false` with an auto-derived trait
